  "code": "var count = 0, last = HIGH;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  pinMode(2, INPUT_PULLUP);\n  pinMode(3, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(4, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nfunction loop() {\n  var r = digitalRead(2);\n  if (last === HIGH && r === LOW) count = (count + 1) % 4;\n  last = r;\n  digitalWrite(3, count & 1);\n  digitalWrite(4, count & 2 ? HIGH : LOW);\n  delay(1);\n}\n"
